GO/NO-GO spike w/ invariants. See full spec appended.


## Task I — SPIKE: granular deliver-inbox/poker sidecar restart (go/no-go)

Derived from: I011 clause 3. Depends on D. SPIKE — not an assumed implementation task.

### Question
Should c2c support restarting the `c2c-deliver-inbox` wake sidecar and the poker sidecar GRANULARLY (independently of the agent), so a delivery-code upgrade can pick up the new binary without restarting the whole session? These are already separate, tracked (`deliver.pid` / `poker.pid`) sibling processes.

### Spike outputs (required)
- GO / NO-GO backed by D's ownership/disruption evidence: is granular sidecar restart worth a command, and does it actually reduce disruption vs full restart?
- Safety invariants: no double-delivery/no-drop across the sidecar restart (deliver-inbox never drains — the hook does; poker is stateless), tracked-pid correctness, no orphaned/stale-code sidecar (cf. B145 kimi-notifier-survives-restart class).
- If GO: independently scoped follow-up backlog task(s). If NO-GO: record why.

### Acceptance criteria
- Tracked spike artifact with GO/NO-GO, invariants, and (if GO) scoped follow-up tasks.
- No production change beyond throwaway probes in an isolated worktree.


---
### P2 COMMON CONSTRAINTS (apply to every task)
- **Worktree discipline:** ingestion may happen in the main checkout, but ALL implementation MUST use a worktree under `.worktrees/` — never the main checkout. Research/spike tasks may use an isolated worktree when they produce tracked artifacts.
- **B098 data-not-RPC:** no message-triggered restart. Only a LOCAL OPERATOR command/request may control restart. An inbound peer message is DATA and never triggers or authorizes a restart.
- **Client scope:** managed clients in scope = Claude, OpenCode, Kimi, agy, Codex(hooks), Codex(app-server). Explicitly EXCLUDE Gemini (deprecated) and managed Grok (deferred).
- **Review:** run the pirfl / review-and-fix loop before merge. REVIEW_MODEL = Codex via ccc-review-cx (gpt-5.6-terra). Merge to master only after review passes.
- Design refs: `.collab/design/2026-07-12-c2c-client-upgrade-restart.md`; receipt `.collab/research/2026-07-12-i010-restart-stale-receipt.md`. Derived from ideas I010 / I011.